    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run an ancient relic demolition company!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the president of a demolition company that handles ancient relics. In a barren world in which all water has dried up, relics are the only available resources. Run your company by giving instructions to your employees for the sake of survival! This game is played by selecting commands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First time dismantling relics? No need to fret--your secretary's here to assist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a competent secretary here to support you, even first-timers can try their hand at demolition. She'll tell you all there is to know about this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Managing your company starts with deploying personnel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose suitable workers, train, and deploy them to grow your business. And don't forget to reward them and let them rest every once in a while. That is, as long as the company can afford it...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek out new resources.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command workers to climb aboard robots made from the dismantled relic parts and send them off to perilous lands. They may even return with precious resources. And of course, you've obtained waiver forms from all employees.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run an ancient relic demolition company!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the president of a demolition company that handles ancient relics. In a barren world in which all water has dried up, relics are the only available resources. Run your company by giving instructions to your employees for the sake of survival! This game is played by selecting commands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First time dismantling relics? No need to fret--your secretary's here to assist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a competent secretary here to support you, even first-timers can try their hand at demolition. She'll tell you all there is to know about this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Managing your company starts with deploying personnel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose suitable workers, train, and deploy them to grow your business. And don't forget to reward them and let them rest every once in a while. That is, as long as the company can afford it...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek out new resources.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command workers to climb aboard robots made from the dismantled relic parts and send them off to perilous lands. They may even return with precious resources. And of course, you've obtained waiver forms from all employees.</p>",
    "short_description": "M.O.Q.R.Company is a sci-fi management simulation game that pays homage to the computer games of the 80s. Step into your role as president of a demolition company that handles ancient relics as you run your company in a dry, barren world!",
